                "text": "CFA \"Inscription\" (Registration)\nFor French-speaking or bilingual candidates, **\"CFA ins\"** is short for *CFA inscription* (registration for the Chartered Financial Analyst exams):\n* To register (*s'inscrire*) for the CFA Program, you must create an account on the official **CFA Institute website**, select your exam window (February, May, August, or November depending on your Level), and complete the registration payment"
